; Numbers the core accepts but whose products leave Decimal's range: the
; plugin must skip the assignment, not panic (#2661 review).
plugin "beancount_options.check_option_assignment"
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2026-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2026-01-01 open Assets:Opt
2026-01-01 open Equity:X
2026-09-03 * "STO"
  Assets:Opt  -1000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P99999999 {1 USD}
  Equity:X
2026-10-16 * "assigned"
  Assets:Opt 1000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P99999999 {}
  Assets:Stock 1 AAPL {1 USD}
  Equity:X
